DaiLoiOS Login Center 1.0.0

Purpose
- Centers the Slick Greeter login panel.
- Keeps the current DaiLoiOS login wallpaper.
- Keeps the existing theme, icons and other greeter settings.
- Restores the original configuration when removed.

Install
  sudo apt install ./dailoios-login-center_1.0.0_all.deb

Test
  Log out, or restart LightDM:
  sudo systemctl restart lightdm

Warning
  Restarting LightDM immediately closes the current desktop session.

Restore
  sudo apt remove dailoios-login-center
